        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>“Without fear.” Since the thirteenth century these words have been the heartbeat of the House of Sutherland. Born within the towering spires of Dunrobin Castle, the motto is carved into the very stone of our ancestral seat. It is more than a creed — it is our distillation philosophy.</p>"
          }
